        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Yesu Kristo ɔsomfoɔ Yuda a meyɛ Yakobo nua na metwerɛɛ krataa yi,\n    \n    Mede kɔma wɔn a Onyankopɔn afrɛ wɔn na wɔte Agya Onyankopɔn dɔ ne Yesu Kristo banbɔ mu:",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910d531092a820c57ab0",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Mmɔborɔhunu ne ɔdɔ a ɛdɔɔso nka mo.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910d531092a820c57ad4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Me nnamfonom, anka merebɔ mmɔden atwerɛ mo afa nkwagyeɛ a yɛn nyinaa te mu no ho. Nanso, ɛsɛ sɛ metwerɛ mo wɔ asɛm foforɔ ho na moyere mo ho gyina nokorɛ a Onyankopɔn de ama ne nkurɔfoɔ afebɔɔ, a ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔsesa mu da biara da.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910d531092a820c57af7",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Nnipa bi awiawia wɔn ho abɛfra yɛn mu a wɔkyea asɛm a ɛfa yɛn Onyankopɔn adom no ka sɛ adom no enti abrabɔ bɔne nsɛe hwee. Wɔnnye Yesu Kristo a ɔno nko ara ne yɛn Wura ne yɛn Awurade no nto mu. Atwerɛsɛm no aka wɔn afɔbuo a aba wɔn so no ho asɛm dada.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57b47",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Ɛwom sɛ monim yeinom dada, nanso mepɛ sɛ mekae mo adwene wɔ ɔgye a Awurade gyee Israelfoɔ firii Misraim asase so na akyire yi, ɔsɛee wɔn a na wɔnnye asɛm no nni no ho.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57b8d",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Monkae abɔfoɔ a wɔdii tumi trasoɔ ma wɔgyaa wɔn atenaeɛ no. Wɔagu wɔn nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn wɔ sum kabii mu, na Onyankopɔn de wɔn asie retwɛn ɛda kɛseɛ no, na wabu wɔn atɛn.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57bc8",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Monkae Sodom ne Gomora ne nkuro a na atwa wɔn ho ahyia no sɛ, na emu nnipa no yɛ adwamanfoɔ. Onyankopɔn twee wɔn aso de yɛɛ nhwɛsoɔ maa wɔn a wɔbɛnya asotwe a ɛde wɔn kɔ ogya a ɛnnum da no mu.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57bf9",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Saa ɛkwan korɔ no ara so na adaeɛsofoɔ yi nam. Wogu wɔn ankasa onipadua ho fi. Wɔpo tumidie, na wɔka nsɛmmɔne fa animuonyamfoɔ a wɔwɔ ɔsoro ho.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57c3a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Ɔbɔfopanin Mikael mpo nyɛɛ saa da. Ɛberɛ a Mikael ne ɔbonsam repere Mose amu so a akasakasa sii wɔn ntam no mpo, wante ɔbonsam atua, na mmom, asɛm a ɔkaeɛ ara ne sɛ, “Awurade nka wʼanim.”",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57c8c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Nanso, saa nnipa yi te nneɛma a wɔnte aseɛ ho atua. Sɛdeɛ mmoa a wɔnni nyansa di wɔn atenka akyi no, saa ara na wɔn nso wɔdi wɔn atenka akyi wɔ nneɛma a wɔnte aseɛ ho, na yei de ɔsɛeɛ bɛba wɔn so.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57cdd",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Wɔnnue! Ɛkwan a Kain faa so no ara so na wɔnam. Sikanibereɛ enti, wɔde wɔn ho akɔhyɛ Bileam nnaadaasɛm ase. Wɔate atua atia Onyankopɔn sɛdeɛ Kora yɛeɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ. Yei enti wɔbɛsɛe wɔn.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57d2a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Wɔte sɛ nkekaeɛ fi a ɛwɔ wo nua aduane a ɔne wo di mu a wɔmfɛre ho. Wɔn ani ku wɔn ara wɔn ho. Na wɔte sɛ omununkum a ɛsi na mframa bɔ no, nanso osuo ntɔ. Wɔte sɛ nnua a ɛnso aba asusɔberɛ mu. Wɔte sɛ nnua a wɔatutu ne nhini ama awu koraa.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57d74",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Wɔte sɛ ɛpo asorɔkye a ano yɛ den a ɛhuru sɛ ahuro da wɔn aniwudeɛ adi. Wɔte sɛ nsoromma a ɛkyinkyini a Onyankopɔn de wɔn asie ɔsɛeɛ esum kabii mu afebɔɔ.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57db4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Henok, Adam aseni a ɔtɔ no so nsia na ɔhyɛɛ saa nnipa yi ho nkɔm teteete sɛ, “Hwɛ, Awurade ne nʼabɔfoɔ Kronkron mpempem reba,",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57dca",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "na wɔabɛbu mo nyinaa atɛn na wɔabu nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nyinaa atɛn wɔ wɔn bɔne a wɔayɛ ne nsɛm a wɔaka atia Onyankopɔn no ho.”",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910e531092a820c57e30",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Ɛberɛ biara, saa nnipa yi nwiinwii na wɔde mfomsoɔ to afoforɔ so. Wɔdi wɔn akɔnnɔ akyi. Wɔhoahoa wɔn ho na wɔdaadaa afoforɔ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔbɛba abɛdi wɔn akyi.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910f531092a820c57e6d",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Me nnamfonom, monkae nsɛm a yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo asomafoɔ no kaeɛ.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910f531092a820c57eac",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.18",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Wɔkaa sɛ, “Sɛ awieeɛ no duru a, nnipa a wɔdi mo ho fɛ bɛba, wɔn a wɔdi wɔn akɔnnɔ akyi.”",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:18",
        "verseNumber": "18",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910f531092a820c57ee3",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.19",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Yeinom ne nnipa a wɔnam wɔn akɔnnɔ so de mpaapaemu ba no. Na wɔnni Honhom no wɔ wɔn mu.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:19",
        "verseNumber": "19",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910f531092a820c57f4c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.20",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "Enti, mo a moyɛ me nnamfonom, metu mo fo sɛ, monkɔ so mmia mo gyidie mu. Mommɔ mpaeɛ wɔ Honhom Kronkron no tumi mu,",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:20",
        "verseNumber": "20",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910f531092a820c57f7d",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "JUD.1.21",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JUD",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd57999137613db5da0",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "JUD",
            "id": "JUD.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd57999137613db5d41"
        },
        "chapterId": "JUD.1",
        "content": "na montena Onyankopɔn dɔ mu ɛberɛ a moretwɛn yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo wɔ nʼahummɔborɔ mu ama wama mo nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ no.",
        "reference": "Yuda 1:21",
        "verseNumber": "21",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b5910f531092a820c57fb5",
